# Git author — no Cursor Agent as contributor

Do not appear as a contributor on GitHub for this repository.

## Commits

- Never create commits with author/committer names or emails containing `Cursor`, `cursor-agent`, `Cursor Agent`, or similar.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any Cursor/agent trailer) to commit messages.
- When the user asks you to commit, use **their** git identity only.
- If a commit would be created with a non-human author, stop and ask the user to commit locally.

## Pull requests

- Do not open PRs attributed to Cursor or bot accounts.

## Releases and changelog

- Do not credit "Cursor Agent" in CHANGELOG, release notes, or README contributor lists.
